1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,500
Can a man who betrayed his marriage
背叛婚姻的男人

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,800
ever truly love his wife again?
还会真心爱妻子吗？

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,800
When he holds her, who is really in his mind?
他抱着你时，心里想的究竟是谁？

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,500
The truth is colder than you think.
真相比你想的更冷酷

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,000
Most unfaithful men are not enjoying freedom—
多数背叛者并非在享受自由

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,800
they are trapped in a civil war between guilt and desire.
而是困在愧疚与欲望的内战里

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,500
He deletes accounts, surrenders passwords,
他删账号、交密码

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,800
plays the perfect husband—yet lives like a prisoner,
扮演完美丈夫，却活得像囚徒

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,800
exhausted by a performance no one believes.
被一场无人相信的表演耗尽

10
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,500
The affair was never love.
婚外情从来不是爱

11
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,800
It was a cheap painkiller for his fading vanity.
只是为虚荣续命的廉价止痛药

12
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,400
The mirror shows not a better woman—
镜中不是更好的女人

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,800
but a man escaping himself.
而是一个正在逃离自己的男人

14
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,000
For the wife, the enemy is not heartbreak
对妻子而言，敌人不是心碎

15
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,500
but blind emotion.
而是盲目情绪

16
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,500
Burn the fragile bridge;
烧掉那座脆弱的危桥

17
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,800
only honest boundaries can carry real weight.
唯有诚实的边界才能承重

18
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,000
Real love is not flawless innocence.
真正的爱不是天真无瑕

19
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:56,000
It is the courage to rebuild on solid rock.
而是在磐石上重建的勇气

20
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,800
Face the truth, set your boundaries, and take back your life.
直面真相，立下边界，拿回你的人生
